<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><title>Hermes Life — World</title></head>
<body><div id="shell"><header><div><h1>HERMES LIFE <span class="pill">WORLD / 0.3.4</span></h1><p>Live pixel world linked to your Hermes execution events</p></div><div id="connection">Connecting…</div></header><main><div class="world-wrap"><div id="game"></div><p class="hint">Click a room for details · Character movement follows genuine Hermes task events</p></div><aside><section><h2>Agent</h2><div class="kv">Room <strong id="room">—</strong></div><div class="kv">Activity <strong id="activity">—</strong></div><div class="kv">Task <strong id="task">—</strong></div></section><details class="fold" ><summary>Independent decisions</summary><section id="decision-section"><h2>Independent decisions</h2><div class="kv">Discovery loop <strong id="decision-state">Checking…</strong></div><label>Scan interval (seconds) <input id="decision-interval" type="number" min="60" max="86400" value="3600" /></label><button type="button" id="decision-toggle">Enable scheduled discovery</button><button type="button" id="decision-scan">Run decision now</button><p id="decision-feedback" role="status"></p><h3>Curiosity queue</h3><div id="curiosity-list"></div></section></details><details class="fold" open><summary>Independent discovery</summary><section id="discovery-section"><h2>Independent discovery</h2><button type="button" id="discovery-scan">Scan VM projects</button><button type="button" id="discovery-refresh">Refresh</button><p class="hint">Read-only TODO/FIXME scan in /home/hermes/projects. Review proposals before they enter the autonomous queue.</p><p id="discovery-status" role="status"></p><div id="discovery-list"></div></section></details><details class="fold" open><summary>Goal formulation</summary><section id="formulation-section"><h2>Goal formulation</h2><p class="hint">Select a discovery and ask Hermes to formulate an evidence-backed proposal. No automatic coding. Approval creates a read-only investigation goal.</p><button id="formulations-refresh" type="button">Refresh proposals</button><p id="formulation-feedback" role="status"></p><div id="formulation-list"></div></section></details><details class="fold" open><summary>Investigation plans</summary><section><h2>Investigation plans</h2><p class="hint">Completed approved investigations can be converted into evidence-backed plans. Plans are review-only; no coding starts automatically.</p><button id="plans-refresh" type="button">Refresh plans</button><p id="plans-feedback" role="status"></p><div id="plans-list"></div></section></details><details class="fold" ><summary>Autonomous goals</summary><section id="autonomy-section"><h2>Autonomous goals</h2><div class="kv">Scheduler <strong id="autonomy-status">Checking…</strong></div><div class="autonomy-actions"><button type="button" id="autonomy-toggle">Enable autonomy</button><button type="button" id="goals-refresh">Refresh</button></div><p class="hint">Disabled by default. Only executes goals added here; one at a time.</p><form id="goal-form"><input id="goal-title" placeholder="Goal title" required maxlength="160"/><textarea id="goal-prompt" placeholder="Exact task Hermes should complete…" required></textarea><label>Priority (0–100) <input id="goal-priority" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="50"/></label><button type="submit">Add goal</button></form><p id="goal-feedback" role="status"></p><div id="goal-list"></div></section></details><section><h2>Submit a task</h2><form id="task-form"><textarea id="prompt" placeholder="Give Hermes a task…" required minlength="1"></textarea><button type="submit">Send to Hermes</button><p id="task-feedback"></p></form></section><details class="fold"><summary>Activity log</summary><section><h2>Activity log</h2><div id="events"></div></section></details><details class="fold"><summary>Selected room</summary><section><h2>Selected room</h2><p id="room-info">Click a room to inspect its function.</p></section></details></aside></main><section id="response-workspace" aria-label="Agent response workspace"><div class="response-top"><div><h2>Agent Response</h2><div class="response-meta"><span id="response-source">Latest agent activity</span><span>Status <strong id="response-status">No task selected</strong></span><span>Task <strong id="response-id">—</strong></span></div></div><div class="response-actions"><button id="response-follow" type="button" aria-pressed="true">Following live</button><button id="response-expand" type="button" title="Expand response workspace">Expand</button><button id="response-copy" type="button">Copy answer</button></div></div><div class="response-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Response content"><button class="response-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-response-tab="answer">Answer</button><button class="response-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-response-tab="tools">Tool activity (<span id="tool-count">0</span>)</button><button class="response-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-response-tab="history">History</button></div><div id="response-error" role="alert" hidden></div><div id="response-answer-panel" class="response-pane" role="tabpanel"><div class="format-switch"><label><input id="response-raw-toggle" type="checkbox"/> Show raw text</label></div><article id="response-rich" class="response-rich" aria-live="polite"><p>Submit a task or select a previous task to view its answer.</p></article><pre id="response-text" class="response-raw" hidden></pre></div><div id="response-tools-panel" class="response-pane" role="tabpanel" hidden><div id="tool-events"></div></div><div id="response-history-panel" class="response-pane" role="tabpanel" hidden><button type="button" id="refresh-history">Refresh history</button><div id="task-history"></div></div></section></div><script type="module" src="/src/main.ts"></script></body></html>
